Grammar

    0 $accept: file $end

    1 types: types type
    2      | type

    3 value: value_lit
    4      | var_name
    5      | null

    6 var_decl_list: var_decl_list var_decl
    7              | ε

    8 structure: _typedef _struct var_name '{' var_decl_list '}' var_name ';'

    9 var_assign: var_name '=' value ';'

   10 var_decl: types var_name ';'

   11 var_decl_assign: types var_name '=' value ';'

   12 instruction: var_assign
   13            | var_decl_assign
   14            | var_decl
   15            | structure

   16 instructions: instructions instruction
   17             | ε

   18 file: instructions


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    ';' (59) 8 9 10 11
    '=' (61) 9 11
    '{' (123) 8
    '}' (125) 8
    error (256)
    null <vstring> (258) 5
    type <vstring> (259) 1 2
    _typedef <vstring> (260) 8
    _struct <vstring> (261) 8
    value_lit <vstring> (262) 3
    var_name <vstring> (263) 4 8 9 10 11


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (13)
        on left: 0
    types <varray> (14)
        on left: 1 2
        on right: 1 10 11
    value <vstring> (15)
        on left: 3 4 5
        on right: 9 11
    var_decl_list <varray> (16)
        on left: 6 7
        on right: 6 8
    structure <varray> (17)
        on left: 8
        on right: 15
    var_assign <varray> (18)
        on left: 9
        on right: 12
    var_decl <varray> (19)
        on left: 10
        on right: 6 14
    var_decl_assign <varray> (20)
        on left: 11
        on right: 13
    instruction <varray> (21)
        on left: 12 13 14 15
        on right: 16
    instructions <varray> (22)
        on left: 16 17
        on right: 16 18
    file (23)
        on left: 18
        on right: 0


State 0

    0 $accept: • file $end

    $default  reduce using rule 17 (instructions)

    instructions  go to state 1
    file          go to state 2


State 1

   16 instructions: instructions • instruction
   18 file: instructions •

    type      shift, and go to state 3
    _typedef  shift, and go to state 4
    var_name  shift, and go to state 5

    $default  reduce using rule 18 (file)

    types            go to state 6
    structure        go to state 7
    var_assign       go to state 8
    var_decl         go to state 9
    var_decl_assign  go to state 10
    instruction      go to state 11


State 2

    0 $accept: file • $end

    $end  shift, and go to state 12


